{"overview":"به‌جای پرواز به فلوریدا با والدینش، کوین به‌تنهایی در نیویورک می‌ماند و با کارت اعتباری پدرش یک اتاق هتل می‌گیرد—اگرچه با مشکلاتی از سوی یک کارمند و پیشخدمت دخالت‌گر مواجه می‌شود. اما وقتی با دشمنان قدیمی‌اش، «دست‌اندرهای خیس»، روبرو می‌شود، مصمم است تا برنامهٔ سرقت فروشگاه اسباب‌بازی در شب کریسمس را ناکام بگذارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Instead of flying to Florida with his folks, Kevin ends up alone in New York, where he gets a hotel room with his dad's credit card—despite problems from a clerk and meddling bellboy. But when Kevin runs into his old nemeses, the Wet Bandits, he's determined to foil their plans to rob a toy store on Christmas Eve.","tagline_en":"He's up past his bedtime in the city that never sleeps.","runtime":120,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["کریس کلمبوس"],"crew_en":["Chris Columbus"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"مکالی کالکین","role":"Kevin","photo":"/5We9Y4zUJ5TUnRgfmkzWQx0mLIF.jpg","en":"Macaulay Culkin"},{"name":"جو پشی","role":"Harry","photo":"/pEHQoL8yOndOq59iXlgsOpUTcTk.jpg","en":"Joe Pesci"},{"name":"دنیل استرن","role":"Marv","photo":"/939oerf8bJPrqT2a0N0oGuM1bjn.jpg","en":"Daniel Stern"},{"name":"کاترین اوهارا","role":"Kate","photo":"/gI2RyymLJ9ZrhEyJSD5EqSvFpCX.jpg","en":"Catherine O'Hara"},{"name":"John Heard","role":"Peter","photo":"/zjhcxrCFK4q0C1gtVmeN8FeqCw0.jpg"},{"name":"Brenda Fricker","role":"Pigeon Lady","photo":"/qE1d7gjcH0dvrS5RViNmagCjb85.jpg"},{"name":"تیم کوری","role":"Concierge","photo":"/8ZsGg3N3OZgxshqLOtA2kl5ckOP.jpg","en":"Tim Curry"},{"name":"Devin Ratray","role":"Buzz","photo":"/uQAINK3xU0SdJXupMtdxzwGc4CS.jpg"},{"name":"Gerry Bamman","role":"Uncle Frank","photo":"/hiMgT6OYvmdgz758vbw4y9iEAns.jpg"},{"name":"راب اشنایدر","role":"Cedric","photo":"/nGHHon86e0rxVV1GVMRuKheqf6L.jpg","en":"Rob Schneider"},{"name":"Michael C. Maronna","role":"Jeff","photo":"/vLmaPosdi7sLutyg5QkJHceRY5F.jpg"},{"name":"Terrie Snell","role":"Aunt Leslie","photo":"/tcIgyeWXEYVrpynMBUnvuYjLirN